{"ref":"BDB, לָט","hw":"לָט","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">לָט</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָאט</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>secrecy, mystery</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָט</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.22\">1 S 18:22</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">לָאט</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:21\" href=\"/Judges.4.21\">Ju 4:21</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לָטֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:22\" href=\"/Exodus.7.22\">Ex 7:22</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">לַהֲטֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:11\" href=\"/Exodus.7.11\">Ex 7:11</a>;—always c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְ</span>:<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלָּט</span> = <em>secretly</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:22\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.22\">1 S 18:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.5\">24:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:7\" href=\"/Ruth.3.7\">Ru 3:7</a>; so <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּלָּאט</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:21\" href=\"/Judges.4.21\">Ju 4:21</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלָטֵיהֶם</span> <em>with their mysteries</em> = enchantments (i.e. of <span dir=\"rtl\">חַרְטֻמֵּי מִצְרַיִם</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:22\" href=\"/Exodus.7.22\">Ex 7:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:3\" href=\"/Exodus.8.3\">8:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:14\" href=\"/Exodus.8.14\">14</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּלַהֲטֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:11\" href=\"/Exodus.7.11\">7:11</a> (all P). S. p. 31 for <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאַט</span> <em>gently</em>.","next":"BDB, לוֹט","prev":"BDB, לוּט"}